Windows dependencies without wxPython (ROADMAP P1-1).

Triage builds KiCad with KICAD_SCRIPTING_WXPYTHON=OFF: the engine has no wx
windows for Python plugins to draw into. Dropping wxpython-33 from the vcpkg
manifest saves its build on every Windows CI cache miss.

